# The web viewer's bundles are esbuild output, checked in so the CMake build
# can embed them too (issue #11065).  See src/web/dist/README.md.
#
# -diff keeps a 2.9 MB minified blob out of `git diff` and out of a PR's
# rendered changes; linguist-generated keeps it out of the language stats and
# collapses it on GitHub.  Regenerate with `bazel run //src/web/dist:dist`.
# Only the artifacts; dist/BUILD and dist/README.md are hand-written and have
# to stay reviewable.
src/web/dist/*.js -diff linguist-generated
src/web/dist/*.css -diff linguist-generated
src/web/dist/*.html -diff linguist-generated
